{
  "_doc": [
    "Round 48: the per-hold intent of scratchpad r49/intent.md (tables 3.1 and 3.2, 2026-10-24) as data. The scene",
    "patches (sect/lib/compose.py: patch_r48_range, patch_r48_isles, patch_r48_green) read it; mist and haze per hold",
    "(phase A, mist.py and the client) can read mist_bands_z and beat. Screen rects are [u0, v0, u1, v1] of the 16:9",
    "frame at the hold camera: u from the left edge, v from the TOP edge, both 0..1.",
    "host: the one background shape the view is built around (it ranks below the star). kind 'moon' (the moon, fully",
    "clear), 'peak' (Range.peaks index, exempt from every cap), 'object' (a scene object), 'sky' (empty sky), 'smoke'.",
    "skyline: the star's roofline stays against sky: a peak behind the star that rises over its top is cut below it.",
    "quiet: rects of designed quiet sky: no peak top and no islet inside them (except the host and the islet zone).",
    "moon: 'clear' (nothing in front of the disc, 1.5 deg margin) or 'hidden' (nothing to do) or null.",
    "islets: at most 'max' visible islands (floating rocks) in the frame, the kept ones inside 'zone'; 'min_dist' m.",
    "falls: false = no waterfall in the frame (rule 9 / intent 3.3.7), except location falls (Ice-Fire Island, abode).",
    "hero_pines: lone Huangshan pines on rims and crests in the frame, against sky or mist (rule 7)."
  ],
